category: Text
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Yet another free document preparation system"
ldesc: "Halibut is a documentation production system, with elements similar to TeX,
debiandoc-sgml, TeXinfo, and others. It is primarily targeted at people
producing software manuals."
